// The data modelling example: domains with their classes, edited in a
// workspace of views. A tree of domains and classes stands at the left; a
// class opens in the class editor that slides out from the right, and the
// domain's class diagram or ERD slides up from the footer. Its modules are
// in the modelling folder next to this file.
project Modelling
    title "Data Modelling"
    stack rust desktop
    output "out"
    language "en"
    datasource main sqlite "data/modelling.db"
